  "description": "Noir skills — the builtin noir-* skill pack, the integrations pack (ClickUp first), and a copy-and-validate compiler.",
  "license": "MIT",
  "author": "agaaaptr",
  "homepage": "https://github.com/agaaaptr/noir#readme",
